## Rate Limiting

### Command Cooldowns
```ts
const commandCooldowns = {
  '/brew': 0, // brewing time is the limiter
  '/garden plant': 1000,
  '/garden harvest': 1000,
  '/shop list': 5000,
  '/shop buy': 2000,
  '/shop reroll': 10000, // + increasing cost
  '/use-potion': 3000,
  '/use-grimoire': 5000,
  '/adventure start': 86400000, // 24h, effect-modifiable
  '/bazaar start': 1800000, // 30min, effect-modifiable
  '/story continue': 1000, // prevent spam during stories
};
```

### Story-Specific Limits
- Cannot start new story if one is active
- Cannot execute most commands while story active (except view/browse)
- Bazaar: Can exit/re-enter freely to brew potions
- Adventures: Must complete or abandon before other actions

## Database Schemas

### Potions Table
```sql
CREATE TABLE potions (
  id UUID PRIMARY KEY,
  name VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL,
  description TEXT NOT NULL,
  flavor_text TEXT,
  tier VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL,
  center_vector vector(8) NOT NULL,
  quality_threshold FLOAT NOT NULL,
  effects JSONB NOT NULL,
